# Backend implementation rules

Follow `spec/requirements.md`, `spec/api.md`, `spec/state-machine.md`, `spec/data-model.md`, `spec/testing.md`, and `rules/implementation.md`.

- Java 21 + Spring Boot + JPA + PostgreSQL (runtime)
- Enforce ticket state machine in the service layer; invalid transitions → 409, no DB change
- No authentication
- No secrets in source; datasource via env vars
- Do not implement frontend under this glob
- Tests must cover valid/invalid transitions and persistence
